    "title": "Populate Next Right Pointers in Each Node",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given a binary tree, connect every node to its immediate neighbor on the same level using a next pointer. If no such neighbor exists, the next pointer must be set to null.",
